### 내 포인트 잔액 (member.http 로그인 먼저)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/points/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 충전 1단계: 주문 생성 / 응답 orderNo 저장
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/charges
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "amount": 10000
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderNo", response.body.orderNo);
%}

### 충전 2단계: 승인 (모의 PG / paymentKey가 fail로 시작하면 실패)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/charges/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "paymentKey": "fake-{{$random.uuid}}",
  "amount": 10000
}

### 포인트 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/points/me/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 콘텐츠 구매 / contentId는 content.http에서 만든 글
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "contentId": 1
}

> {%
    client.global.set("purchaseId", response.body.purchaseId);
%}

### 내 구매 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchases/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 환불 (본문 열람 전 + 7일 이내)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "잘못 구매"
}
